(!usage_data) {\n \t\t\t\tPLData pld;\n \t\t\t\tpld.uses = 0;\n \t\t\t\tpld.info = F;\n \t\t\t\tpld.info.name = F.name;\n \t\t\t\tusage[F.name] = pld;\n-\t\t\t\tdata_list.push_back(usage.getptr(F.name));\n+\t\t\t\tusage_data = usage.getptr(F.name);","path":"editor/inspector/multi_node_edit.cpp","commit_id":"1c8e3f9037c30ec02bfa67d53008d301a107b3b5","original_commit_id":"20e1cfb10f5ce5e8bb965a231f398289ba180527","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks like the `Iterator` just stores a `HashMapElement *` and `I->` is actually an operator overload for `I.data->`, so the pointer will end up pointing to a property of a persistent `HashMapElement` and should be safe to use.","created_at":"2025-08-31T21:22:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T21:22:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109515#discussion_r2312634560","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109515","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2312634560"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109515#discussion_r2312634560"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109515"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2312634560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":157,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":158,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2298413501,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":13,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2312667365","pull_request_review_id":3171831228,"id":2312667365,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6J2IDl","diff_hunk":"@@ -74,8 +74,12 @@ class MultiNodeEdit : public RefCounted {\n \t\tif (get_node_count() != p_other->get_node_count()) {\n \t\t\treturn false;\n \t\t}\n+\t\tHashSet<NodePath> nodes_in_selection;","path":"editor/inspector/multi_node_edit.h","commit_id":"1c8e3f9037c30ec02bfa67d53008d301a107b3b5","original_commit_id":"20e1cfb10f5ce5e8bb965a231f398289ba180527","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Okay, so there's a lot of context to this change. This is a partial fix for the case where you are switching to a scene tab that already has a large selection. To reproduce the issue, you would:\r\n- Open `Sprite25k.tscn`. Select all 25k nodes.\r\n- Open `MeshInstance.tscn`.\r\n- Try to switch back to `Sprite25k.tscn`. This will lag so badly you might as well restart godot.\r\n\r\nThere's actually two different slow operations that lag the tab switch, and this is only one of the two. The second (and much more severe) issue, which is that the scene tree dock attempts to scroll to each selected node individually, I haven't put up a fix PR for yet, it's still on my backlog. This makes it difficult to show on a `master` build why this is needed, but if you apply the patch\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp b/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp\r\nindex c964393f2c..ed185440bd 100644\r\n--- a/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp\r\n+++ b/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp\r\n@@ -1039,7 +1039,7 @@ bool SceneTreeEditor::_update_filter(TreeItem *p_parent, bool p_scroll_to_select\r\n        bool keep_for_children = false;\r\n        for (TreeItem *child = p_parent->get_first_child(); child; child = child->get_next()) {\r\n                // Always keep if at least one of the children are kept.\r\n-               keep_for_children = _update_filter(child, p_scroll_to_selected) || keep_for_children;\r\n+               keep_for_children = _update_filter(child, p_scroll_to_selected && !keep_for_children) || keep_for_children;\r\n        }\r\n \r\n        if (!is_root) {\r\n```\r\nso that it only scrolls to the first child, then you'll be able to see that impact of this change.\r\n\r\nWith all of my speed up PRs and the above patch, it takes about 3 seconds to switch, and as shown in the below flamegraph, about 50% of that time (1.6s) is spent in `is_same_selection`. \r\n<img width=\"2544\" height=\"1331\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/588ce9fd-411e-4344-a01d-151c7945cb29\" />\r\n\r\nRunning the same test with the `is_same_selection` change, as well, results in the below flamegraph and a scene switch time of about 1.5s. The time spent in `is_same_selection` is now less than 3 ms, a 500x improvement in the function's runtime.\r\n<img width=\"3416\" height=\"1282\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2452ca1-599d-4a54-93c8-e4e7374f369f\" />\r\n","created_at":"2025-08-31T23:12:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T23:29:36Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109515#discussion_r2312667365","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109515","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2312667365"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109515#discussion_r2312667365"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109515"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2312667365/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":77,"original_line":77,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2298430183,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"}]